1
00:00:04,010 --> 00:00:06,100
So… where's Tawan, P'?

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,631
He didn't come here?

3
00:00:10,631 --> 00:00:18,991
And what happened to your lip?

4
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:25,969
Oh— I bit my own lip,
that's why it looks like this.

5
00:00:28,133 --> 00:00:30,869
Hmm… maybe Tawan already left.

6
00:00:31,348 --> 00:00:35,905
Left?
Yeah.

7
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:44,351
Can I ask you to take care of Gun for me?

8
00:00:45,920 --> 00:00:51,080
Huh? What about Earth?

9
00:00:51,080 --> 00:00:55,616
I'm just scared that Gun might…

10
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:01,664
Let him stay at your place tonight.

11
00:01:01,664 --> 00:01:06,000
But what if he does something to you… like—

12
00:01:08,759 --> 00:01:14,840
You're the one who said
he never does anything to you, right?

13
00:01:14,840 --> 00:01:20,213
But what if he thinks you're Earth?
He's already acting weird right now…

14
00:01:23,190 --> 00:01:27,840
Ugh…

15
00:01:27,840 --> 00:01:31,495
It's fine, Gun.

16
00:01:31,495 --> 00:01:33,937
How about this—

17
00:01:34,168 --> 00:01:39,096
I'll take him to my room first,
and Earth stays with me tonight.

18
00:01:40,020 --> 00:01:41,308
Tomorrow morning
I'll bring him back to Gun.

19
00:01:56,600 --> 00:01:59,600
Okay.
